==Uses==
===Item charging===
Revenant ether is used to charge the following [[wilderness weapons]] and other items:
* {{plink|Craw's bow}}
* {{plink|Webweaver bow}}
* {{plink|Thammaron's sceptre}}<sup>([[Thammaron's sceptre (a)|autocasting]])</sup>
* {{plink|Accursed sceptre}}<sup>([[Accursed sceptre (a)|autocasting]])</sup>
* {{plink|Viggora's chainmace}}
* {{plink|Ursine chainmace}}
* {{plink|Bracelet of ethereum}}

Disassembling various uncharged items will give the player revenant ether:
